flowchart LR
    A[Prefill prompt] --> B[Save state]
    B --> C[Decode baseline next token]
    C --> D[Evict context/model residency]
    D --> E[Reload residency]
    E --> F[Restore saved state]
    F --> G[Decode restored next token]
    G --> H{Token IDs match?}
    H -->|Yes| I[resume_match=yes]
    H -->|No| J[resume_match=no]
